ADS5282 50MHz existing_low idle_high: illustrative driver, not vendor IBIS
* C60/C61=100n assumed from schematic; fitted values must be verified.
* ADS clock-input bias is 5k per leg to 1.5V typical, DIFF_CLK=1.
* Input capacitance 5e-12/5e-12 F, driver resistance and line are ASSUMPTIONS.
* Steady-state capacitor precharge is analytic; idle cases start fully rebias-settled.
Vp sp 0 PULSE(1.89 0 100n 1e-09 1e-09 9e-09 20n)
Vn sn 0 0
Rp sp dp 10
Rn sn dn 10
Rwirep dp p 0.001
Rwiren dn n 0.001
R165 p n 100
C61 p ap 100n
C60 n an 100n
Vbias bias 0 1.575
Rbp ap bias 5k
Rbn an bias 5k
Cap ap 0 5e-12
Can an 0 5e-12
Cfpgafloat dn 0 3p
.ic v(ap)=1.575 v(an)=1.575 v(p)=1.7324999999999997 v(n)=0.1575 v(dp)=1.7324999999999997 v(dn)=0.1575
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-12
.tran 0.05n 420n uic
.save v(p) v(n) v(ap) v(an) i(Vp) i(Vn)
.end
